---
source: crates/specforge-cli/src/main.rs
expression: command.clone().render_long_help().to_string()
---
Render the extension architecture (dependencies, enhancements, contributions)

Usage: specforge outline [OPTIONS] [PATH]

Arguments:
  [PATH]
          Path to the spec root directory
          
          [default: .]

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format

          Possible values:
          - markdown
          - mermaid:  flowchart
          - dot:      Graphviz
          - json
          
          [default: markdown]

      --fields <FIELDS>
          Detail level

          Possible values:
          - none: counts only
          - keys: names and rule codes
          - all:  full field attribution
          
          [default: keys]

      --deps <DEPS>
          Dependency visibility

          Possible values:
          - direct:    declared only
          - effective: direct and used transitive
          - full:      all transitive
          
          [default: direct]

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
